@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: WWW Request A Demo
	Frontend testing for the www request a demo page

Scenario: View Request A Demo Page
	End users should be able to view the request a demo page and form.

	Given I go to the www page with the url "request-a-demo"
	Then I should be able to view the Request a Demo page and form
	Given I go to the www homepage
	And I click on the Request a Live Demo button
	Then I should be able to view the Request a Demo page and form
	Given I go to the www homepage
	And I click on the footer "Request a Demo" link under the "Platform" footer category
	Then I should be able to view the Request a Demo page and form